rip-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://dx1g8igict72o.cloudfront.net/trips/thumbnails/6a68a422e093b0.52830955.jpg\" alt=\"Old Manali\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"/><div class=\"trip-tag tag-open\">Open</div><div class=\"trip-host-bar\"><img class=\"trip-host-av\" src=\"https://dx1g8igict72o.cloudfront.net/uploads/6a647b5cca05d8.50281750.jpg\" alt=\"Paras Pundir\"/><div><div class=\"trip-host-name\">Hosted by <!-- -->Paras Pundir</div><div class=\"trip-host-role\">Pro Traveller </div></div></div></div><div class=\"trip-body\"><div class=\"trip-title\">Slowcation 9.0</div><div class=\"trip-footer\"><div><div class=\"trip-price-num\">₹21,999</div><div class=\"trip-price-label\">Per Person</div></div><button class=\"btn-primary btn-primary\" style=\"width:auto;padding:8px 16px;font-size:0.75rem;box-shadow:none\">Book Now</button></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"twpi-vibe\"><div class=\"twpi-vibe-stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"twpi-vibe-watermark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">travel raw</div><div class=\"twpi-vibe-head\"><span class=\"twpi-eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">Why the Pro way</span><h2 class=\"twpi-h2\">Built by travellers, <em>for travellers</em></h2><p class=\"twpi-vibe-sub\">Under the same stars you&#x27;ll camp beneath - this is what makes a TWP trip feel nothing like a tour.</p></div><div class=\"twpi-pillars\"><div class=\"twpi-pillar\"><span class=\"twpi-pillar-num\">0<!-- -->1</span><div class=\"twpi-pillar-icon\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76\"></polygon></svg></div><div class=\"twpi-pillar-title\">Led by Real Travellers</div><p class=\"twpi-pillar-desc\">Not agencies. Every trip is hosted by someone who&#x27;s actually walked that path.